The amount is 100.
The sign is 0.
If amount is less than 0, set sign to 1, set amount to 0 minus amount.
The digits is an empty list of whole numbers.
If amount is 0, Place 0 into digits.
Repeat while amount is more than 0.
The digit is amount modulo 7.
Place digit into digits.
Set amount to amount divided by 7.

The parts is an empty list of text.
If sign is 1, Place "-" into parts.
The last is the last position of digits.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The place is last minus spot.
The piece is format whole number item place of digits as text.
Place piece into parts.

The result is join parts with "".
Show result.
